    `there was a loss of control of the model` IS FALSE
    `the loss of control caused death or bodily injury` IS FALSE
    `the model used deceptive techniques against me to subvert my controls or monitoring` IS FALSE
    `that happened in an evaluation designed to elicit that behavior` IS FALSE
    `that behavior demonstrates materially increased catastrophic risk` IS FALSE

