GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`indep: CSI with a model of` ops i MEANS
    `is this a critical safety incident` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE ops
        (i's `there was unauthorized access to, modification of, or exfiltration of the model weights`)
        (i's `that access, modification, or exfiltration resulted in death or bodily injury`)
        (i's `the model's conduct`)
        (i's `the model materially contributed to the deaths, injuries, or damage`)
        (i's `the deaths, injuries, or damage arose from a single incident`)
        (i's `the number of people who died or were seriously injured`)
        (i's `the dollars of damage to, or loss of, property`)
        (i's `the harm came from information the model output that is otherwise publicly accessible in a substantially similar form from a source other than a foundation model`)
        (i's `the harm came from lawful activity of the federal government`)
        (i's `there was a loss of control of the model`)
        (i's `the loss of control caused death or bodily injury`)
        (i's `the model used deceptive techniques against me to subvert my controls or monitoring`)
        (i's `that happened in an evaluation designed to elicit that behavior`)
        (i's `that behavior demonstrates materially increased catastrophic risk`)

